活的千金\n坠入爱河，义无反顾\n世俗眼光，我不在乎\n只要有你，便已足够\n\n[Bridge]\n或许结局，注定悲伤\n但我无悔，这段过往\n哪怕陨落，化为尘埃\n也曾拥有，最美的爱\n\n[Chorus]\n不知死活的千金\n坠入爱河，义无反顾\n世俗眼光，我不在乎\n只要有你，便已足够\n\n[Outro]\n无悔的爱，永恒的誓言\n不知死活，亦无遗憾"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}], "flags": {}, "id": 114, "type": "CR Prompt Text", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Prompt Text"}, "order": 9}], "extra": {"VHS_KeepIntermediate": true, "links_added_by_ue": [], "workspace_info": {"saveLock": false, "id": "4S3cAzlUO-QUG2_LwV8kh"}, "VHS_MetadataImage": true, "ue_links": [], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "workflowRendererVersion": "LG", "VHS_latentpreviewrate": 0, "frontendVersion": "1.37.11", "VHS_latentpreview": false, "ds": {"offset": [2425.950425889757, 677.582029554579], "scale": 0.45}}, "groups": [{"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 1, "title": "Step 1 - Load Models", "bounding": [-470, -860, 720, 460]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 3, "title": "Step3 - Prompt", "bounding": [260, -860, 640, 960]}], "links": [[119, 47, 0, 3, 2, "CONDITIONING"], [175, 78, 0, 3, 0, "MODEL"], [249, 98, 0, 3, 3, "LATENT"], [254, 94, 0, 3, 1, "CONDITIONING"], [255, 94, 0, 47, 0, "CONDITIONING"], [256, 3, 0, 18, 0, "LATENT"], [257, 102, 0, 94, 3, "INT"], [258, 102, 0, 3, 4, "INT"], [260, 104, 0, 78, 0, "MODEL"], [261, 105, 0, 94, 0, "CLIP"], [262, 106, 0, 18, 1, "VAE"], [263, 18, 0, 107, 0, "AUDIO"], [264, 114, 0, 94, 2, "STRING"], [265, 113, 0, 94, 1, "STRING"], [266, 115, 0, 98, 0, "FLOAT"], [267, 115, 0, 94, 5, "FLOAT"]], "id": "88ac5dad-efd7-40bb-84fe-fbaefdee1fa9", "config": {}, "version": 0.4, "last_node_id": 118, "revision": 0}